Hi {Owner},

I build websites for imaging centres and labs around {City}. {Business Name} is well reviewed, but the site doesn't show self-pay prices, prep instructions or a way to book a scan or test online, and there's nothing for referring doctors.

I built a sample first rather than ask for a meeting: a scan and test menu with self-pay prices, prep notes sent with every booking, booking with referral upload, collection centres with early hours and a referring doctor page, with marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

If it's useful, I finish it in phases for {Build Range}, connected to your scheduling system, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting and updates. Your medical director approves every price and prep note before it publishes.

Worth twenty minutes this week?

{Your Name}
{Your Studio} · {Your Phone}
{Your Physical Address}

Reply "stop" and I won't contact you again.
